WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:33.660
I'm Orphen, a black sorcerer
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:37.397
Five years ago, the magician
| looked up to, Azalie,

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:40.867
activated the Heavenly Beings'
Sword of Baltanders

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.870
and became the magical beast Bloody August.

00:01:44.805 --> 00:01:47.374
After leaving the Tower of Fangs
in search of Azalie,

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:50.611
I, with my apprentice Majic and Cleao,

00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:53.847
began a quest to restore Azalie
to her normal human state.

00:01:54.014 --> 00:01:56.416
Let's go Majic! Cleao!

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.618
To our next adventure!

00:01:57.618 --> 00:01:58.819
To the next town!

00:02:19.039 --> 00:02:25.045
The shrimp man
of frlENOShlp

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:48.068
Well, you be careful now!

00:02:48.068 --> 00:02:49.336
Thank you very much!

00:02:49.503 --> 00:02:51.304
Thank you very much!

00:02:54.241 --> 00:02:56.810
Are you really going, Master?

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.479
Why are you going back now?

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:03.183
I'm sure if I go there,
I'll find out something.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.056
At the Tower of Fangs...

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:21.902
It seems Krylancelo is coming closer?

00:03:21.902 --> 00:03:26.406
Yes, according to Lai's clairvoyance,
he's four or five days away.

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:29.309
I'll go!

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:32.746
If he provokes the Elders
anymore than this, he'll...

00:03:33.447 --> 00:03:35.215
Even if you give him a warning,

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.918
he isn't one to meekly do as you advise.

00:03:37.918 --> 00:03:39.486
Please, I beg of you, Master!

00:03:39.486 --> 00:03:42.789
Let's inform him, Krylancelo, of everything!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.693
If he knew your thoughts, Master,
even he would probably understand.

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:51.798
That subject is a secret
between only you and I.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:54.301
Revealing it to others is needless.

00:03:54.301 --> 00:03:55.402
But, Master!

00:03:55.402 --> 00:03:57.104
You're importunate, Hartia.

00:03:59.139 --> 00:04:00.307
My apologies.

00:04:00.307 --> 00:04:01.341
Master...

00:04:02.209 --> 00:04:03.777
The Elders call for you.

00:04:06.513 --> 00:04:07.514
I'll go now.

00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:15.322
The Tower of Fangs has, until now,
closed its eyes to the actions of Krylancelo.

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:19.226
But if he should further defy us

00:04:19.226 --> 00:04:23.964
by proving to be an obstacle to
the obliteration of Azalie...

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:28.468
Childman, at that time, as you were his Master,

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:31.304
you, by your own hand,
will dispose of Krylancelo.

00:04:31.304 --> 00:04:34.608
Azalie is the disgrace of the Tower of Fangs.

00:04:34.608 --> 00:04:38.678
And thus too is Krylancelo,
who allies himself with that Azalie.

00:04:38.979 --> 00:04:42.215
So saying, we have given our decision.

00:04:53.093 --> 00:04:55.729
Looks like it's been a while
since they abandoned the village.

00:04:55.729 --> 00:04:57.230
It's kind of creepy.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.439
Looks like we'll be able to
get some water though.

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:12.112
Eeeww! All these spider webs!

00:05:18.552 --> 00:05:19.553
Leki?

00:05:25.192 --> 00:05:26.459
Cleao!

00:05:26.927 --> 00:05:28.461
Let's go, Leki!

00:05:37.304 --> 00:05:39.172
It's hard to call this a hotel.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.741
All the same, we can stay
out of the morning dew.

00:05:44.077 --> 00:05:45.378
Eeeww!

00:05:45.946 --> 00:05:47.447
This feels gross!

00:05:54.421 --> 00:05:55.455
It's food.

00:05:55.455 --> 00:05:57.123
That'll help!

00:05:58.792 --> 00:06:00.393
But is it all right?

00:06:03.797 --> 00:06:06.833
Well, if we clean it up,
we should be able to use it.

00:06:09.436 --> 00:06:11.204
What're you doing, Leki?

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:19.579
See, because you were mischievous,
you got wet!

00:06:21.381 --> 00:06:24.818
Quit it, Leki, you little cutie!

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.329
Volcan! Dortin!

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:40.166
P-please help!

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:42.836
Orphen!

00:06:42.836 --> 00:06:44.771
What's wrong you guys?

00:06:45.005 --> 00:06:47.007
All of the sudden Big Brother...

00:06:48.475 --> 00:06:50.143
What a high fever!

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:59.352
My golden piggy bank got
swept away by the typhoon!

00:06:59.953 --> 00:07:03.390
Stop it! Don't eat my money!

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:05.425
Big Brother, hold on!

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:09.362
Really, it's because you eat rotten mushrooms.

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:10.730
Rotten mushrooms?

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:12.866
Let's see...

00:07:12.866 --> 00:07:14.000
Like this one.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:14.901
What?

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:17.704
You know, this is a poisonous mushroom.

00:07:17.704 --> 00:07:20.073
He always eats them and is fine.

00:07:20.073 --> 00:07:21.841
What a stomach he must have.

00:07:22.909 --> 00:07:27.914
Even though this is the kind of creature he is,
to me, he's my one and only Big Brother.

00:07:28.548 --> 00:07:31.785
Please save my Big Brother!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.625
Feels good!

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:41.928
It's the wrath of Heaven,
because everything he does is so bad.

00:07:41.928 --> 00:07:43.530
I think that's going a little too far.

00:07:44.364 --> 00:07:46.866
That's not true! After all-

00:07:46.866 --> 00:07:47.968
I'm going out for a bit.

00:07:47.968 --> 00:07:49.302
Where are you going now?

00:07:49.302 --> 00:07:52.172
To the mountains.
I'm going to find some herbs.

00:07:52.172 --> 00:07:55.075
Orphen, just leave him alone and he'll be fine!

00:07:55.075 --> 00:07:56.710
There's no reason to cater to him!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.179
At least go tomorrow morning?

00:08:00.447 --> 00:08:02.148
It's worth his life.

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:03.984
He probably won't last until tomorrow morning.

00:08:05.952 --> 00:08:10.423
He betrays people,
and doesn't pay back his debts.

00:08:11.124 --> 00:08:13.226
He's the worst kind of person,
but I can't just watch him die.

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:14.527
I'll go with you!

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:15.729
I'm fine alone!

00:08:16.062 --> 00:08:17.630
I'll try to be back soon.

00:09:12.952 --> 00:09:14.287
Dortin!

00:09:18.358 --> 00:09:20.927
| wonder where Dortin went?

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.478
Who are you?!

00:09:39.212 --> 00:09:42.015
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:09:42.482 --> 00:09:46.719
| have a covenant with the night
and by day, I live hiding my face.

00:09:48.188 --> 00:09:50.423
| am the embodiment of fear and evil!

00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:53.326
Of the House of Demonic Dreams,
my name is...

00:10:02.469 --> 00:10:05.305
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:10:05.305 --> 00:10:09.109
| have a covenant with the night
and by day, I live hiding my face.

00:10:09.109 --> 00:10:10.410
The embodiment of fear...

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.311
Pervert!

00:10:14.247 --> 00:10:17.083
You mega-pervert! Perverted man! Pervert!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:18.218
Halt! I am not a pervert!

00:10:18.218 --> 00:10:19.419
Pervert!
Halt! I am not a pervert!

00:10:19.419 --> 00:10:20.120
Halt! I am not a pervert!

00:10:22.055 --> 00:10:23.289
| said halt!

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:24.124
You!

00:10:34.534 --> 00:10:36.136
You pervert!

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:37.537
Y-you're wrong!

00:10:38.338 --> 00:10:40.840
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.675
| have a covenant with the night-

00:10:42.675 --> 00:10:44.077
| already heard that part!

00:10:44.077 --> 00:10:46.079
Really? Then...

00:10:47.413 --> 00:10:50.884
Of the House of Demonic Dreams,
the Black Tiger!

00:10:51.117 --> 00:10:52.519
Black Tiger?

00:10:53.052 --> 00:10:54.988
You know this pervert?

00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:56.656
That's why I've been stating you're mistaken!

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.460
| think I've heard of him.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:02.595
Black... Black Tiger...

00:11:03.062 --> 00:11:05.298
There's no use in speaking with you.

00:11:05.298 --> 00:11:07.534
Bring out the black sorcerer.

00:11:07.534 --> 00:11:09.302
Orphen's out.

00:11:09.302 --> 00:11:10.703
What? Out?

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:12.705
Hey, I remember!

00:11:12.705 --> 00:11:14.140
The Black Tiger is...

00:11:15.108 --> 00:11:16.976
If I remember correctly, it's...

00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:18.444
The name of a shrimp!

00:11:30.223 --> 00:11:32.926
Apparently, I've just wasted a trip.

00:11:32.926 --> 00:11:33.927
Carolina!

00:11:35.228 --> 00:11:37.063
So you're going to run, Shrimp Man?!

00:11:37.063 --> 00:11:38.698
Who's a Shrimp Man?!

00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:41.401
What do you want with my Master, Shrimp Man?!

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:44.237
I'm not a Shrimp Man!

00:11:44.571 --> 00:11:47.240
My name is Black Tiger.

00:11:47.607 --> 00:11:50.043
You forgot this, Shrimp Man!

00:11:50.643 --> 00:11:52.445
Black Tiger!

00:11:52.912 --> 00:11:54.247
I'll be back.

00:12:02.822 --> 00:12:05.491
What was that? What a loser.

00:12:36.155 --> 00:12:38.558
Okay, now the fever will go down.

00:12:41.961 --> 00:12:45.498
Black Tiger is a fictional sorcerer
who appears in picture books.

00:12:45.498 --> 00:12:46.833
Picture books?

00:12:47.267 --> 00:12:49.335
He was the kind of hero you wanted to be.

00:12:49.335 --> 00:12:51.904
When I was a kid I was pretty hooked too.

00:12:51.904 --> 00:12:54.574
It seemed like he knew you.

00:12:54.574 --> 00:12:56.476
Does he ring a bell for you, Master?

00:12:56.476 --> 00:12:57.910
Yeah, well.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:58.978
Who?

00:13:00.246 --> 00:13:02.982
More importantly,
I'm worried about the missing Dortin.

00:13:02.982 --> 00:13:04.651
Let's split up and look for him.

00:13:04.651 --> 00:13:05.485
Yes!

00:13:09.355 --> 00:13:11.524
Oh, yeah, Leki.

00:13:11.724 --> 00:13:13.226
Leki, where are you?

00:13:36.449 --> 00:13:37.950
Dortin!

00:13:38.184 --> 00:13:40.286
Where are you?! Dortin!

00:13:40.286 --> 00:13:41.688
Dortin!

00:13:44.991 --> 00:13:46.492
This is...

00:13:52.131 --> 00:13:53.866
Leki!

00:14:01.274 --> 00:14:02.375
Leki?

00:14:05.178 --> 00:14:06.346
Leki!

00:14:18.224 --> 00:14:19.192
Cleao!

00:14:31.404 --> 00:14:32.405
Cleao!

00:14:33.239 --> 00:14:35.141
It's a giant spider!

00:14:35.908 --> 00:14:38.111
Help me, Majic!

00:14:38.111 --> 00:14:39.412
Wait, okay?

00:14:42.248 --> 00:14:44.250
Cleao, I'm going to help you now!

00:14:49.489 --> 00:14:52.158
That can't be. There's one more!

00:15:03.169 --> 00:15:05.471
Orders from the Tower of Fangs?

00:15:06.072 --> 00:15:08.207
Why don't you just show yourself already?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.044
Tower of Fangs?

00:15:12.979 --> 00:15:14.914
That has nothing to do with it!

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:17.650
| am the assassin who lives in the night.

00:15:18.584 --> 00:15:20.286
The Black Tiger!

00:15:23.489 --> 00:15:24.824
What's so funny?!

00:15:24.824 --> 00:15:26.225
So, your dream came true?

00:15:26.225 --> 00:15:27.326
What?

00:15:27.326 --> 00:15:31.864
Didn't you say, "When I grow up,
I'm going to be the Black Tiger!"

00:15:32.265 --> 00:15:33.866
What are you talking about?

00:15:33.866 --> 00:15:35.835
| know nothing of you!

00:15:35.835 --> 00:15:38.438
But I am going to the Tower of Fangs,

00:15:38.438 --> 00:15:40.673
even if I have to defeat you, my dear friend!

00:15:45.678 --> 00:15:48.114
Sword of the Descending Demon,
that I do carry!

00:16:18.511 --> 00:16:22.348
Feel bad... It's just like when I ate dirt.

00:16:26.052 --> 00:16:27.787
Where am I?

00:16:28.387 --> 00:16:29.789
Dortin!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:33.092
Where are you, Dortin?

00:16:33.459 --> 00:16:36.229
Geez, where did he go?

00:16:37.697 --> 00:16:39.699
Th-the Sword of Baltanders!

00:16:39.966 --> 00:16:41.968
Throwing it down in a place like this!

00:16:43.803 --> 00:16:45.972
And to top it off, unsheathing it!

00:16:45.972 --> 00:16:47.773
If I find him, I'll strangle him.

00:16:54.981 --> 00:16:56.549
What's this?

00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:59.519
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:17:02.822 --> 00:17:04.790
Like I'd fall for the same thing twice?!

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:07.426
Mirror!

00:17:11.564 --> 00:17:12.632
What?!

00:17:17.603 --> 00:17:20.606
Damn, which one's the real one?

00:17:42.995 --> 00:17:44.964
Someone! Help!

00:17:44.964 --> 00:17:47.500
| wouldn't even taste good.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.569
What are you guys doing?

00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:52.438
B-Big Brother!

00:17:52.438 --> 00:17:55.975
Don't talk so loud! My head throbs!

00:17:55.975 --> 00:17:58.277
Hurry and cut these threads, Big Brother!

00:17:58.277 --> 00:18:00.780
If you don't hurry, they'll come back!

00:18:01.013 --> 00:18:02.114
They?

00:18:02.114 --> 00:18:03.449
Who cares!

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:07.086
I'm saved!

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:09.522
Volcan, please save us too!

00:18:09.522 --> 00:18:10.856
You're so naive!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:15.261
Make some small talk.
If you make me laugh, then I'll save you.

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:16.395
Quit joking!

00:18:16.395 --> 00:18:20.433
Hey, I can't believe you can act so thanklessly!

00:18:20.533 --> 00:18:22.935
Okay, small talk number one.

00:18:22.935 --> 00:18:26.172
Big Brother, these people saved your life.

00:18:26.639 --> 00:18:28.174
Saved my life?

00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:33.546
S-spiders!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:36.315
Run!

00:18:37.083 --> 00:18:38.150
<i>I'm S 0! Ty!</i>

00:18:47.226 --> 00:18:50.663
| see. I've found a way to tell the real one apart.

00:18:50.663 --> 00:18:52.331
Words of a poor loser?

00:18:52.865 --> 00:18:54.200
I've seen through your magic!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.536
Guide me, O Starling of Death!

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:04.343
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:19:18.124 --> 00:19:19.125
Fire!

00:19:24.296 --> 00:19:25.331
O Light!

00:19:30.569 --> 00:19:32.038
You are...

00:19:33.939 --> 00:19:36.108
I shall issue you a warning!

00:19:36.542 --> 00:19:38.511
Do not approach the Tower of Fangs!

00:19:38.811 --> 00:19:40.613
I'm prepared for danger!

00:19:40.613 --> 00:19:41.714
Krylancelo!

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:44.817
| can't forgive them!

00:19:44.817 --> 00:19:48.521
They would murder Azalie
for their own lives, for their idiotic honor!

00:19:48.521 --> 00:19:51.323
The Tower of Fangs!

00:19:51.791 --> 00:19:54.160
And Childman too!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.027
You're
wrong!

00:19:55.027 --> 00:19:56.562
How am I wrong?

00:19:56.562 --> 00:19:58.397
Childman would kill his students
without a thought!

00:19:58.397 --> 00:20:00.199
He doesn't have tears or blood.
He's a murderer!

00:20:00.466 --> 00:20:01.901
You don't understand.

00:20:02.601 --> 00:20:05.171
You have the wrong impression of
the kind of person Childman is!

00:20:05.171 --> 00:20:06.505
The wrong impression?

00:20:06.505 --> 00:20:08.174
He... he is...

00:20:08.474 --> 00:20:09.942
You know, he is...

00:20:12.144 --> 00:20:13.345
Childman!

00:20:22.788 --> 00:20:23.622
Wait!

00:20:23.622 --> 00:20:25.958
Master, please stop.

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:28.627
That person rescued us!

00:20:28.627 --> 00:20:29.462
What?

00:20:38.738 --> 00:20:40.740
Such willful actions.

00:20:41.207 --> 00:20:47.613
| didn't want to see you and Krylancelo
fighting at the order of the Elders!

00:20:49.181 --> 00:20:50.516
Sol...

00:21:09.168 --> 00:21:10.736
Bloody August!

00:21:21.747 --> 00:21:22.848
Fire!

00:21:26.986 --> 00:21:27.720
What?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.861
This is...

00:21:46.906 --> 00:21:48.040
M-Master!

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:48.874
What?

00:21:48.874 --> 00:21:51.243
Bloody August is at the Tower of Fangs!

00:21:51.243 --> 00:21:52.278
What?!

00:22:13.632 --> 00:22:15.768
We've finally arrived at the Tower of Fangs!

00:22:15.768 --> 00:22:20.406
We're able to sneak in,
because Bloody August broke the shield.

00:22:20.406 --> 00:22:23.375
And hopefully it'll go as smoothly all the way
to the archives where the Books of Shadows are.

00:22:23.976 --> 00:22:25.644
They found us!

00:22:25.644 --> 00:22:28.948
With so many sorcerers,
we don't have a chance of winning!

00:22:28.948 --> 00:22:31.684
What are you going to do, Master?

00:22:31.884 --> 00:22:33.619
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:33.619 --> 00:22:35.988
Back to my hometown, REMINISCENCE
"Back to My Hometown, Reminiscence."

00:22:35.988 --> 00:22:37.990
Back to my hometown, REMINISCENCE
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:38.591
Back to my hometown,
REMINISCENCE

00:22:48.968 --> 00:22:53.038
Honto ni sukidatta anata ga inai

00:22:53.038 --> 00:22:57.109
Hajimete no koi todomatta

00:22:57.576 --> 00:23:05.818
Konya wa yume ni egao no mama de detekonaide yo ne

00:23:06.452 --> 00:23:10.489
Saigo no serif u kuchi ni dasumade

